{"ID":"20240205153635-sc6fy7w","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153635-sc6fy7w","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153635-sc6fy7w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112041-z77hhvp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112054-qtvmop1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112041-z77hhvp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"合欢花","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112059-zcjxgre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112059-zcjxgre","updated":"20240206112102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、陕西、江苏、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t呈卷筒状或浅槽状，粗细长短不一，长1550cm，厚0.20.3cm。外表在炭绿色或灰棕色，稍有纵皱纹，横向皮孔密生，椭圆形，棕红色，偶有突起的横棱或较大的圆形绝痕 (侧枝痕) 。内表面淡黄色，有细纵纹。质硬而脆，断面黄白色，呈纤维性刺片状。气微，味涩而微苦，稍刺舌，而后喉头有不适感。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t舒郁、理气、安神、活络、养血、滋阴肾、清心明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112054-qtvmop1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112054-qtvmop1","updated":"20240206112054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112054-ni7clxe.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705163704-bnnynw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705163704-bnnynw9","updated":"20240705163704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626154358-775if74.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 306px;","style":"width: 296px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢2-20240626154510-6u9e9my.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 296px;\" parent-style=\"width: 306px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821140945-k3hv0sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821140945-k3hv0sr","updated":"20240821140945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 309px;","style":"width: 299px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢-20240626154821-xxyuywe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 299px;\" parent-style=\"width: 309px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 951px;","style":"width: 941px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢1-20240626154701-2gvfax1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 941px;\" parent-style=\"width: 951px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821140945-5e3lktu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821140945-5e3lktu","updated":"20240821140945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 666px;","style":"width: 656px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢6-20240626155206-t6v1pob.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 656px;\" parent-style=\"width: 666px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 564px;","style":"width: 554px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 4-20240821140852-33li5kb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 554px;\" parent-style=\"width: 564px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821140945-rbzno5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821140945-rbzno5o","updated":"20240821140945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 929px;","style":"width: 919px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 2-20240821140710-kg11q08.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 919px;\" parent-style=\"width: 929px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 309px;","style":"width: 299px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 3-20240821140736-brxqp7z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 299px;\" parent-style=\"width: 309px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821140945-y8qjf7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821140945-y8qjf7a","updated":"20240821140945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢-20240821140618-np4526p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢 1-20240821140638-yqd987a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705163728-w7cyrwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705163728-w7cyrwe","updated":"20240705163728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 987px;","style":"width: 977px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"合欢4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/合欢4-20240626155018-bng4hci.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 977px;\" parent-style=\"width: 987px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705163731-9jc03gh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240705163731-9jc03gh"}},{"ID":"20240830163011-hhi0ivi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-hhi0ivi","updated":"20240830163017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：合欢花"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-7f971bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-7f971bg","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢花《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-bgqx2ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-bgqx2ww","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HéHuānHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-n35pwiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-n35pwiy","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FLOSALBIZIAE"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-gk3l0t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-gk3l0t8","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为豆科植物合欢AlbiziajulibrissinDurazz.的干燥花序。夏季花开放时择晴天采收，及时晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-wxy2j8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-wxy2j8r","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为头状花序，皱缩成团。花细长而弯曲，长0.7～1cm，淡黄棕色至淡黄褐色，具短梗。花萼筒状，先端有5小齿；花冠筒长约为萼筒的2倍，先端5裂，裂片披针形；雄蕊多数，花丝细长，黄棕色至黄褐色，下部合生，上部分离，伸出花冠筒外。气微香，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-o337fge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-o337fge","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-n2uzegi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-n2uzegi","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末灰黄色。非腺毛单细胞，微弯曲，长81～447μm，直径8～16μｍ，壁较厚，表面有疣状突起，有的可见1～2菲薄横隔。草酸钙方晶多存在于薄壁细胞中，呈双锥形、类方形、长方形或菱形，直径3～31μm，含晶细胞成群或数个纵行排列。复合花粉粒呈扁球形，为16合体，直径81～146μm，中央8个分体排列成上下交迭的十字形，其余8个围在四周；单个分体呈类方形或长球形，外壁几光滑。花丝表皮细胞表面观长条形或长方形，垂周壁平直，具纵向弯曲的细条状角质纹理。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-jl0izpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-jl0izpo","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加乙醚10ml，放置1小时，滤过，滤液挥干，残渣加醋酸乙酯0.5ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取合欢花对照药材，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各6μl，分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以正己烷－醋酸乙酯（17:3）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以5％香草醛硫酸溶液，热风吹至斑点显色清晰。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-ng408iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-ng408iq","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-k9v5u14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-k9v5u14","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-t1r3r2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-t1r3r2t","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解郁安神。用于心神不安，忧郁失眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-mokx3s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-mokx3s1","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】4.5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-cacv3ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-cacv3ih","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-mnqx9y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-mnqx9y6","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-jlsznv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-jlsznv3","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢花《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-dpibwwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-dpibwwz","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-3rj7awq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-3rj7awq","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HéHuānHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-w7w36ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-w7w36ub","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】夜合花（《本草衍义》），乌绒（《雷公炮制药性解》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-mvug86b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-mvug86b","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为豆科植物合欢的花或花蕾。6月花初开时采的花，商品称合欢花，花未开时采的花蕾，商品称合欢米，除去枝叶，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-1fkqsgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-1fkqsgj","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】形态详\"合欢皮\"条"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-wdwqu8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-wdwqu8n","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】药材产浙江、安徽、江苏、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-5jec6jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-5jec6jx","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-wajttcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-wajttcz","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①合欢花：干燥花序呈团块状，有如棉絮。小花长约0.8～1厘米，弯曲，淡黄褐色或绿黄色；花冠筒状，先端5裂，外面有长柔毛；花萼细筒状，绿黄色；雄蕊多数，花丝细长，伸出花冠外，交织紊乱，易断。微香。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-glrvxyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-glrvxyw","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②合欢米：干燥花蕾，青绿色，不分瓣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-xj37rcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-xj37rcf","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-7dk22jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-7dk22jj","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-ffngslg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-ffngslg","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《四川中药志》：\"性平，味苦，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-fqyql1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-fqyql1n","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②江西《中草药学》：\"甘，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-omajjg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-omajjg6","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】《四川中药志》：\"入心、脾等经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-nmlik20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-nmlik20","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-0ma541n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-0ma541n","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舒郁，理气，安神，活络。治郁结胸闷，失眠，健忘，风火眼疾，视物不清，咽痛，痈肿，跌打损伤疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-0rjbi4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-0rjbi4g","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草便读》：\"能养血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-darugy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-darugy4","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《分类草药性》：\"能清心明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-hmg17z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-hmg17z9","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《四川中药志》：\"能合心志，开胃理气，消风明目，解郁。治心虚失眠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-8dvqji0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-8dvqji0","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④江西《中草药学》：\"解郁安神，和络止痛。治肝郁胸闷，忧而不乐，健忘失眠。有时还用于跌打损伤，痈肿疼痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-xrcql3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-xrcql3w","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《东北常用中草药手册》：\"治咽喉疼痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-jgroeax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-jgroeax","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-4pxde9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-4pxde9n","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-9qafv03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-9qafv03","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治心肾不交失眠：合欢花、官桂、黄连、夜交藤。煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-rfpc0ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-rfpc0ks","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风火眼疾：合欢花配鸡肝、羊肝或猪肝，蒸服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-dctiq9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-dctiq9p","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治眼雾不明：合欢花、一朵云，泡酒服。（①方以下出《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-da7bkht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-da7bkht","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治打搕损疼痛：夜合花末，酒调服二钱匕。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-8dea29o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-8dea29o","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治腰脚疼痛久不差：夜合花四两，牛膝一两（去苗），红蓝花一两，石盐一两，杏仁半两（汤浸去皮，麸炒微黄），桂心一两。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和捣百余杵，丸如梧桐子大。每日空心，以温酒下三十丸，晚食前再服。（《圣惠方》夜合花丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-mj7ljsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-mj7ljsk","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】四川地区尚用同属植物山合欢的花和花蕾。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-t692cl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-t692cl6","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-t82xhql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-t82xhql","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢花《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-5akhksj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-5akhksj","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-m69sw86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-m69sw86","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HéHuānHuā"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-6r755df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-6r755df","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FlowerofSilktreeAlbizzia"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-uqt8mmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-uqt8mmo","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】夜合花、乌绒"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-a6uxltm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-a6uxltm","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-r4kipn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-r4kipn5","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为豆科植物合欢的花或花蕾。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-arwj7bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-arwj7bm","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：AlbiziajulibrissinDurazz."}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-eou5wem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-eou5wem","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏季花初开时采收，除去枝叶，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-gpx0twq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-gpx0twq","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】合欢，落叶乔木，高可达16m。树干灰黑色；嫩枝、花序和叶轴被绒毛或短柔毛。托叶线状披针形，较小叶小，早落；二回羽状复叶，互生；总叶柄长3-5cm，总花柄近基部及最顶1对羽片着生处各有一枚腺体；羽片4-12对，栽培的有时达20对；小叶10-30对，线形至长圆形，长6-12mm，宽1-4mm，向上偏斜，先端有小尖头，有缘毛，有时在下面或仅中脉上有短柔毛；中脉紧靠上边缘。头状花序在枝顶排成圆锥大辩论花序；花粉红色；花萼管状，长3mm；花冠长8mm，裂片三角形，长1.5mm，花萼、花冠外均被短柔毛；雄蕊多数，基部合生，花丝细长；子房上位，花柱几与花丝等长，柱头圆柱形。荚果带状，长9-15cm，宽1.5-2.5cm，嫩荚有柔毛，老荚无毛。花期6-7月；果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-4bim44k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-4bim44k","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-olphkp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-olphkp7","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山坡或栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-jkj6tnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-jkj6tnv","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华东、中南及西南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-b7a5a3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-b7a5a3b","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-znu55kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-znu55kc","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别(1)合欢花头状花序皱缩成团。花细长而弯曲，长0.7-1cm，淡黄棕色或淡黄褐色，具短梗。花萼筒状，先端5小齿，疏生短柔毛；花冠筒长约为萼筒的2倍，先端5裂，裂片披针形，疏生短柔毛；雄蕊多数，花丝细长，黄棕色或黄褐色，下部合生，上部分离，伸出冠筒外。体轻易碎。气微香，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-m3xdf30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-m3xdf30","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)合欢米花蕾米粒状，青绿色或黄绿色，有毛。下部1/3被萼筒包裹。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-ve1rnyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-ve1rnyj","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别粉末特征：灰黄色。①非腺毛单细胞，微弯曲，长81-447μm，直径8-16μm，壁较厚，表面有疣状突起，有的可见菲薄横隔。②草酸钙方晶双锥形、类方形、长方形或菱形，直径3-13μm，含晶细胞成群或数个纵行排列。③复合花粉粒扁球形，为16合体，直径81-146μm，中央8个分体排列成上下交叠的十字形，其余8个围在四周；单个分体类方形或长球形，外壁几光滑。④花丝表皮细胞表面观长条形或长方形，垂周壁平直，具纵向弯曲的细条状角质纹理。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-ejzx8kf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-ejzx8kf","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】花中鉴定了25种芳香成分，主要芳香成分为反-芳樟醇氧化物(linalooloxide)，芳樟醇(linalool)，异戊醇(isopentanol)，a-罗勒烯(a-ocimene)和2，2，4-三甲基恶丁烷(2，2，4-trimethylixetane)等。此外，还含矢车菊素-3-葡萄糖甙(cyanidin-3-glucoside)。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-h7axs62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-h7axs62","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】抑制作用实验研究表明，合欢花煎剂灌服，能明显减少小鼠的自发活动及被动活动，明显协同巴比妥类药物的中枢抑制作用，延长戊巴比妥钠、苯巴比妥钠所致小鼠麻醉时间，促使阈下剂量的戊巴比妥钠、异戊巴比妥钠引起小鼠麻醉，一次给药或连续给药3d均有显着效果。合欢花煎剂给家兔灌服未见脑电有明显改变，也无抗戊四氮所致小鼠惊厥作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-ox6tlmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-ox6tlmz","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘苦；平；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-1zsmmwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-1zsmmwe","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-2qwjs42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-2qwjs42","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解郁安神，理气开胃，消风明目，活血止痛。主忧郁失眠，胸闷纳呆，风火眼疾，视物不清，腰痛，跌打伤痛"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-ntcz2dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-ntcz2dt","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-9g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-1wr6fe4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-1wr6fe4","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚津伤者慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-qzh6102","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-qzh6102","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.夜合花丸(圣惠方)，主治腰脚疼痛久不差。2.经验方：合欢花、官桂、黄连、夜交藤。用于心肾不交失眠。3.验方(子母秘录)，夜合花，为末，酒调服，主治跌打损伤疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-hht645q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-hht645q","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-xx8diec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-xx8diec","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草便读》：能养血。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-v1h3y41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-v1h3y41","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《分类草药性》：能清心明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-zp7wvm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-zp7wvm9","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《四川中药志》：能合心志，开胃理气，消风明目，解郁。治心虚失眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-2va423m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-2va423m","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.江西《中草药学》：解郁安神，和络止痛。治肝郁胸闷，忧而不乐，健忘失眠。有时还用于跌打损伤，痈肿疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-9tz60ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-9tz60ci","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《东北常用中草药手册》：治咽喉疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163011-bwmoipy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163011-bwmoipy","updated":"20240830163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163012-4b5h0fz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830163012-4b5h0fz","updated":"20240830163032"}},{"ID":"20240830163013-76fu9f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163013-76fu9f2","updated":"20240830163032"}}]}